      "evidenceText": "Aric Toler on X: \"Ignoring all the political stuff, it is interesting/depressing how even when you just do what seems like \"harmless\" image editing with an AI tool, it gives the new image an unmistakable AI sheen to skin and the background. And, of course, it changes the actual objects themselves.\" / X Post Log in Sign up Post Log in Sign up Aric Toler on X: \"Ignoring all the political stuff, it is interesting/depressing how even when you just do what seems like \"harmless\" image editing with an AI tool, it gives the new image an unmistakable AI sheen to skin and the background. And, of course, it changes the actual objects themselves.\" Conversation Aric Toler @AricToler Ignoring all the political stuff, it is interesting/depressing how even when you just do what seems like \"harmless\" image editing with an AI tool, it gives the new image an unmistakable AI sheen to skin and the background. And, of course, it changes the actual objects themselves. Olivia Reingold @Olivia_Reingold Nov 5 Hello my name is Olivia Reingold and I used ChatGPT to brighten and sharpen an image of a woman in Valentino shoes and a Chanel bag. After processing, it still shows these same things: a woman wearing Valentino shoes and a Chanel bag. She is a real (and chic!) woman, really 5:43 PM · Nov 5, 2026 · 131.7K Views 27 80 800 100 Log in or sign up for X See what’s happening and join the conversation Continue with phone Continue with Apple Continue with Google or Log in with username or email Relevant people Aric Toler @ AricToler Follow @nytimes Visual Investigations Previously @bellingcat [email protected] bsky.app/profile/aric.b… Signal/Telegram/WhatsApp: +1 913-209-0215 What’s happening Show more Aric Toler @AricToler Ignoring all the political stuff, it is interesting/depressing how even when you just do what seems like \"harmless\" image editing with an AI tool, it gives the new image an unmistakable AI sheen to skin and the background. And, of course, it