      "evidenceText": "Consulting & Coaching - Poynter Consulting & Coaching - Poynter DONATE What do you want to search? Submit Sign In | Membership News Training Ethics Fact-Checking Media Literacy AI Events Future of Public Media Newmark Ethics Center IFCN MediaWise PolitiFact Donate About Us Press Freedom Watch The Poynter 50 Podcasts Artificial Intelligence Business & Work Reporting & Editing Fact-Checking Ethics & Trust Local News Journalism, Media & Communication Training Poynter Membership Categories Consulting & Coaching For ACES Members For Local News Funders All Categories Broadcast & Visual Journalism Business & Work Ethics Fact-Checking & Media Literacy Leadership Reporting & Editing Writing Poynter ACES Introductory Certificate in Editing Poynter ACES Intermediate Certificate in Editing Poynter ACES Advanced Certificate in Editing Workshops and Coaching Tools for Funders Ethics Ethics Training Ethics Articles AI Ethics Public Editor Project Get Ethics Advice Fact-Checking Articles IFCN IFCN Grants International Fact-Checking Day Teen Creator Network PolitiFact MediaWise Media Literacy Resources AI Literacy Ambassadors Teen Creator Network Research & News International en Español MediaWise Training All Events The 2026 Poynter Journalism Prizes Poynter’s experts help you solve the problems that keep you up at night through consulting, coaching, custom training and facilitation.   At Poynter, we understand the pressures you’re navigating – from financial constraints to audience shifts, management challenges to ethical dilemmas. Our trainers and coaches provide practical, customized solutions built on decades of industry expertise. We don’t offer generic approaches. Poynter delivers actionable strategies tailored to your specific needs, including training managers to lead high-performing teams, facilitating strategic planning retreats, and offering personalized consulting to help move change forward, develop your ethics and standards, or navigate a crisis. Each year, we work with large traditional newspapers to small digital startups, from television to radio, commercial and nonprofit, communicators and content writers in public relations, marketing and corporate communications, and creators spanning social platforms, independent projects, podcasts and emerging media. We measure success by your results – healthier organizational culture, more collaborative teams; better management practices; diversified revenue streams, stronger ethical standards, and ultimately, journalism that better serves your community. Partner with Poynter Consulting to transform your challenges into opportunities and strengthen your organization’s future. Leadership Development Grow leaders. Strengthen your newsroom. LEARN MORE Coaching Personalized guidance. Sustainable growth. LEARN MORE Retreat Facilitation Get the results your meeting is meant to deliver. LEARN MORE Ethics & Standards Strengthen trust. Align values. Empower your newsroom. LEARN MORE Craft Elevate your work. Deepen your impact. LEARN MORE Organizational Strategy Solve complex challenges. Build for what’s next. LEARN MORE AI & Emerging Technologies Lead with integrity. Innovate with purpose. LEARN MORE Fact-checking & Media Literacy Empower your audience. Build trust in journalism. Learn More Describe your needs and schedule a conversation with our team. \" * \" indicates required fields Name * First Last Email * Phone * Organization name * This field is hidden when viewing the form What best describes you/your team? Journalist Journalism Student/School/Teacher/Professor Newsroom Nonprofit Communications/Marketing Team Professional Association Research Organization Government Entity Other This field is hidden when viewing the form Other Describe the type of organization. What are you hoping to purchase? * Leadership Development Coaching Retreat or Event Facilitation Ethics and Standards Craft Organizational Strategy AI and Emerging Technologies Fact-checking & Media Literacy